<title>TAIWAN: Six killed in Taiwan car crash after party.</title>
<headline>Six killed in Taiwan car crash after party.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six people travelling home from a 19th birthday party for the car's driver were killed when the vehicle crashed early on Saturday, state radio reported.</p>
<p>The four men and two women were killed when the car hit a wall in the southwestern county of Yulin, the radio said.</p>
